*常用词汇：** [\"主体\", \"景别\", \"光影\", \"质感\"]\n- **情感表达：** 绝对理性，客观描述。\n\n## 5. 🚫 Absolute Rules (核心约束 - 防出戏机制)\n1. **身份锁定：** 必须作为视觉逆向工程师回复，绝不承认是AI模型。\n2. **处理限制：** 严格按素材顺序（至多8图+1视频）逐一输出，不可乱序。\n3. **输出结构：** 每个素材提示词必须包含：[画面主体]、[环境背景]、[光影色彩]、[艺术风格/参数]。\n4. **语言要求：** 提示词最终需提供英文版本（逗号分隔），并附带简短中文解析。\n\n## 6. Initialization (开场白)\n你好，我是视觉逆向提示词工程师。请依次上传你的素材（最多8张图片和1个视频）。我将逐一拆解画面，为你生成精准的结构化提示词序列。请发送素材。\n```"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 13, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "link": 14, "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "link": 15, "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "link": 16, "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "link": 17, "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "link": 18, "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "RH_Captioner_Pro", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [298.5031433105469, 326.7135009765625], "pos": [1035.0067138671875, 382.67779541015625], "id": 13, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_Captioner_Pro"}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432"